  data:
    Id: bear_jug_root
    DisplayName: The Juggernaut
    Description: 'Fury comes with the turn and comes faster the nearer he is to death:
      15 at full health, 20 at three quarters, 35 at half, 60 at a quarter or less.
      None for swinging, none for being hit, and it never drains when idle. Unlocks
      Second Wind, on a 4-turn cooldown. Free, but only one path''s root talent can
      be active at a time; respec to change it.'
